        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac{5}{4}$\n\nExpress both sides as powers of $2$ and equate the indices.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2^2)^{x-1}&=\\frac{1}{2^4\\times2^{1/2}}\\\\2^{2x-2}&=2^{-9/2}\\\\2x-2&=-\\frac{9}{2}\\\\2x&=-\\frac{5}{2}\\\\x&=-\\frac{5}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
